Z||000016||Oreif||05-17-2001||10:38 PM||||Haze, Thanks!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Sootah, I take the door emblems off of a car and use my super secret epoxy paint (so the colors won't fade, chip, crack, or yellow) Then I carefully finish the black with super secret sand paper then coat them with a super secret clear coating so that they'll shine and last for ever.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>87ECO5, You are correct I stopped making the "Red Horse" now I make the "Red Logo with white letters" Only you have the original "Red Horse".  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>FieroGTguy, Yes, Send me 3 sets and you'll get a GT style back. I'll Email you later tonight with the address. (at work right now)<BR><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">    <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B>||||reg||1
